:: RobinTemple Joint Examination
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Jordan>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.monthly_checked>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<robin-temple-examination-prepare true>>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Joint Examination Result
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Jordan>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.monthly_checked>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<robin-temple-examination-partners true>>
  <<if (C.npc.Robin.virginity.vaginal and C.npc.Robin.virginity.penile
    and C.npc.Sydney.virginity.vaginal and C.npc.Sydney.virginity.penile
    and $player.virginity.penile is true and $player.virginity.vaginal is true)
    or ($player.virginity.temple is true and C.npc.Robin.virginity.temple is true and C.npc.Sydney.virginity.temple is true)>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='gold'>The powder gives off intense sparks.</span> Jordan smiles. "You have remained faithful to one another. Let this continue." Robin and Sydney embrace you.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class='gold'>粉末闪起了激烈的火花。</span>约旦微笑起来。“你们对彼此忠诚，希望继续保持。”罗宾和悉尼拥住了你。
    <</language>>
    <<stress -6>><<lstress>><br><br>
    <<if playerChastity() and $worn.genitals.origin is 'temple'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          With one anxious motion, Jordan returns your $worn.genitals.name to its place, guarding your crotch.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          约旦小心地将你的$worn.genitals.cn_name_cap归回原位，遮住你的胯部。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
    <<robin-temple-examination-success>>
    <<clotheson>><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='red'>It remains inert.</span> Jordan frowns. "I’m sorry. One of you has become impure."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class='red'>粉末毫无反应。</span>约旦皱起眉头。“抱歉，你们有人已经污浊了。”
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<robin-temple-purification-summons true>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Joint Refuse
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Jordan>><<person1>>
<<if !$RobinTemple.monthly_checked and $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin' and $templePromised is 'Sydney'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Then I must assume the worst," Jordan says, looking at <<his>> feet.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “那我必须设想最坏的情况。”约旦说，直直地盯着脚尖。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<robin-temple-purification-summons true>>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Joint Admit
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Jordan>><<person1>>
<<if !$RobinTemple.monthly_checked and $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin' and $templePromised is 'Sydney'>>
  <<if $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I, I haven’t kept it," you say. "I’m sorry. I’m so sorry..."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我，我没有守节，”你说，“抱歉，我真的很抱歉……”
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "No need," you say. "I haven’t been faithful."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “没必要了，”你说，“我没能保持忠诚。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I’m sorry," you say. "I haven’t been faithful."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “抱歉，”你说，“我没有保持忠诚。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Thank you for your honesty," Jordan says, looking at <<his>> feet.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “谢谢你的坦诚。”约旦说，直直地盯着脚尖。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<robin-temple-purification-summons true>>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
